@startuml
title Slice 4: AI連携・同意・ログ管理クラス図
caption 学生の作業ログと同意状態を収集し、AI評価の入力として整形する設計

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

class Student {
  + studentId: String
  + consentStatus: ConsentStatus
  + reviewConsent()
  + grantConsent()
  + withdrawConsent()
}

class ConsentRecord {
  + consentId: String
  + studentId: String
  + taskId: String
  + status: ConsentStatus
  + consentedAt: DateTime
  + version: String
}

class CodeLog {
  + logId: String
  + studentId: String
  + taskId: String
  + capturedAt: DateTime
  + eventType: LogEventType
  + snapshotText: String
  + runOutput: String
  + saveMetadata: String
}

class AuditLog {
  + auditId: String
  + actorId: String
  + actorRole: String
  + action: String
  + occurredAt: DateTime
  + summary: String
}

class EvaluationInputBuilder {
  + buildRequest(task: Task, rubric: Rubric, prompt: Prompt, logs: List<CodeLog>, submission: Submission, consent: ConsentRecord): EvaluationRequest
}

class EvaluationRequest {
  + requestId: String
  + taskId: String
  + promptVersion: String
  + rubricVersion: String
  + actorRole: String
  + consentStatus: String
  + meta: Map<String, String>
  + generatedJson: String
}

class GeminiAdapter {
  + sendRequest(request: EvaluationRequest): GeminiResponse
  + validateResponse(response: GeminiResponse): Boolean
}

class GeminiResponse {
  + responseId: String
  + scores: Map<String, Integer>
  + reasons: String
  + confidence: Float
  + warnings: List<String>
}

class Task {
  + taskId: String
  + title: String
  + promptVersion: String
  + rubricVersion: String
}

class Prompt {
  + promptId: String
  + version: String
  + content: String
}

class Rubric {
  + rubricId: String
  + version: String
  + criteria: List<String>
}

class Submission {
  + submissionId: String
  + studentId: String
  + taskId: String
  + submittedCode: String
  + submittedAt: DateTime
}

Student "1" --> "0..*" ConsentRecord : 同意状態を保持
Student "1" --> "0..*" CodeLog : 30秒ログを残す
Student "1" --> "0..*" Submission : 提出物を作成

CodeLog "0..*" --> "1" EvaluationInputBuilder : AI入力の元データ
Submission "1" --> "1" EvaluationInputBuilder : 提出情報を渡す
ConsentRecord "1" --> "1" EvaluationInputBuilder : 同意状態を含める
Task "1" --> "1" EvaluationInputBuilder : 課題情報を渡す
Prompt "1" --> "1" EvaluationInputBuilder : プロンプトを渡す
Rubric "1" --> "1" EvaluationInputBuilder : ルーブリックを渡す

EvaluationInputBuilder "1" --> "1" EvaluationRequest : JSONを生成
EvaluationRequest "1" --> "1" GeminiAdapter : APIへ送信
GeminiAdapter "1" --> "1" GeminiResponse : 結果を受信

AuditLog "0..*" --> "1" Student : 操作履歴として記録
AuditLog "0..*" --> "1" Teacher : 監査対象として残す

note right of ConsentRecord
  同意状態は評価入力に含めるが、
  主要な評価対象は作業ログと提出物である
end note

@enduml
